- Keep nonspendable fallback VTXOs out of successful recovery results.
  Report them as skipped while preserving their stored bodies and protections.
  [#19](https://github.com/BullishNode/scuttle/pull/19)
- Report unsupported offer currencies without a parse panic.
  Bitcoin offers, including amountless offers, retain their existing amount checks.
  [#19](https://github.com/BullishNode/scuttle/pull/19)
- Classify confirmed conflicting spends by the requested scan window.
  Emergency exits no longer treat an older Esplora result as a recent conflict.
  [#19](https://github.com/BullishNode/scuttle/pull/19)
